#: ../../source/templates_ollama.md:83
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ollama.md:84
msgid ""
"**Rounded display, standard body**: SF Pro Rounded carries display "
"headlines with its distinctive rounded terminals, while the standard "
"system sans handles all body text. The rounded font IS the brand "
"expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ollama.md:85
msgid ""
"**Weight restraint**: Only two weights matter — 400 (regular) for body "
"and 500 (medium) for headings. No bold, no light, no black weight. This "
"extreme restraint reinforces the minimal philosophy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ollama.md:86
msgid ""
"**Tight display, comfortable body**: Headlines compress to 1.0 line-"
"height, while body text relaxes to 1.43–1.56. The contrast creates clear "
"hierarchy without needing weight contrast."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ollama.md:87
msgid ""
"**Monospace for developer identity**: Code blocks and terminal commands "
"appear throughout as primary content, using the system monospace stack."
msgstr ""

